# BossEncounterDatabase
# Fields: mapId | enemyId | preFightEventPath | defeatedFlag | musicContext
#
# mapId           — exact value from MapComponent::getCurrentMapId()
# enemyId         — must match an id in enemies.db
# preFightEventPath — path to event file, or empty for no cutscene
# defeatedFlag    — GameFlag set on victory; prevents re-triggering
# musicContext    — MusicManager context key, or empty to use area default

# Header row (skipped by parser)
mapId|enemyId|preFightEventPath|defeatedFlag|musicContext

# Example — replace FOREST_8 with your actual map node id
FOREST_8|forest_boss|Assets/Events/Bosses/forest_boss_intro.txt|forest_boss_defeated|combat_boss